        "semantics": "per arm (right first): 7 Panda joint targets, then the 16 Allegro joint targets. The arm's targets are turned into a tcp target by forward kinematics (as POST /kinematics fk) and the arm tracks that pose through the same operational-space controller as ee_pose, whose null space pulls towards DexJoCo's home posture: the tcp reaches FK(q), the measured joints may differ from q in the arm's redundant direction. Rows `dt` apart, `linear` (in joint space) or `hold`; values outside the limits are clipped and reported."
